Perhaps you had sleep resistance.  This happened to me once in pl6 and
I thought I was exploiting some bug, but eventually I starved.  You
last longer with sleep resistance because you don't waste lots of
turns flat on your face.  The mode word "Fainted" is wrong, since
obviously you have not fainted.  It should say "Starving".  Come to
think of it, in pl7 I think you faint even if you have sleep
resistance.  Maybe it is an obscure bug, but exploiting it can be
fatal, in my experience.

